            "review_title": "Review at Hana Maru Ramen",
            "review_text": "Brian L\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam268 contributions\n0\nGreat Lunch Specials\nJul 2019 • Solo\nI went to Hana Maru for lunch today and was impressed with the \"lunch special menus\" available. Something for everybody! I chose the breaded pork set (tonkatsu) which is accompanied by soup, pickles, vegetables, cabbage salad and rice for only VND65K.\nService was polite and efficient and the food delicious. Iced water is available at no charge.\nRECOMMEND IF YOU ARE IN THE AREA TO TRY THIS PLACE.\nRamen are also very good I am told by a friend who recently ate there\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten July 29, 2019",
