            "review_title": "Review at Hana Maru Ramen",
            "review_text": "Denise K\n4 contributions\n0\nBest ramen I have had outside of Japan so far\nJul 2018 • Friends\nThere’s just a few simple dishes. Me and friends all picked a simple ramen with all toppings and additional cheese. The noodles were delicious as well as al the toppings, although the meat I’d preffer to be more thick. The best thing about the whole food was the broth tho, little salty but fricking delicious. \nThis could very well become my daily meal if I’d lived in Saigon.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 25, 2018",
